<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="del-trans-2026-06-crypt"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Recorded items for month 2026-06</title></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><p>Created by members of the TLS project</p></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation>Initially created: <date>2026-06-01T00:10:22.566+09:00</date>.</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Items</head><p xml:id="del-2026-06-start"><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T00:10:22.566+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.1.1There was a Stranger from Qin who consulted the Host of the Eastern Wilds as follows:</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T00:10:47.863+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">And there again, when Zhongni came to hear the "Shao" music</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T00:12:01.072+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.1.2 So, then, the emotions of grief and wistfulness</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T00:13:39.183+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.1.2a And there again, when Zhongni came to hear the "Shao" music</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T00:15:01.143+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.1.3 These are established facts of the past,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T00:17:50.786+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">Now just you alone have this idea that there is no emotion like grief and joy in the the sounds (of music).</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T00:18:20.736+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">Address to the Host  1.1.4.1  Now just you alone have this idea that there is no emotion like grief and joy in the the sounds (of music):</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T00:18:28.322+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">and when Ji Zha listened to the string music</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T00:18:35.953+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">【Second historical evidence text 1.1.2b and when Ji Zha listened to the string music</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T00:18:54.702+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">First historical evidence text  1.1.2a     And there again, when Zhongni came to hear the "Shao" music</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T00:19:33.429+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">General statement of fact 1.1.2    So, then, the emotions of grief and wistfulness</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T00:20:20.133+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">Opening basic questions. 1.1.1.  There was a Stranger from Qin who consulted the Host of the Eastern Wilds as follows:</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T00:21:30.873+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.1.4 If you have terrific investigations to report</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T00:23:36.596+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.1.1 The Host responded as follows:</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T00:24:19.935+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">【Opening general statement on the issue 1.2.1】 The Host responded as follows:</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.28" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T00:26:13.167+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.2 So, without delay , having gratefully received your guidance</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T00:28:37.45+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.2 So then: When the two vital energies of Heaven and Earth commerge</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.38" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T01:21:50.362+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.1.3No matter how excellent or otherwise</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.40" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T01:22:37.081+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">their essential substance remains the natural same</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.38" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T01:24:29.652+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">【1.2.1.3】 No matter how excellent or otherwise</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.42" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T01:25:34.472+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.4 How would one change the handling of these things in terms of preference or aversion</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.38" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T01:26:59.971+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">【1.2.2.2】 No matter how excellent or otherwise</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.42" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T01:27:36.185+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.2.3 How would one change the handling of these things in terms of preference or aversion</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.44" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T01:28:13.602+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.5 That the tones like gong and shang, when gathered and juxtaposed,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.48" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T01:28:48.302+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.6 The ancients were aware that emotions must not be indulgent,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.44" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T01:30:50.771+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.3 That the tones like gong and shang, when gathered and juxtaposed,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.48" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T01:33:34.727+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.4  The ancients were aware that emotions must not be indulgent,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.54" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T01:34:21.956+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.7 For practical reasons one gives names to things,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.54" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:23:43.071+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">【The logical and conceptual background 1.2.5】 For practical reasons one gives names to things,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.59" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:26:34.506+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.8.1 So then: the Music says this; the Music says that,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.59" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:26:56.334+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">Logical arguments, first series 1.2.8.1 So then: the Music says this; the Music says that,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.73" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:27:41.345+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.8.2 Now if on the basis of quite the same feelings</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.59" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:28:02.8+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">Logical arguments.   1.2.8.1 So then: the Music says this; the Music says that,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.76" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:29:07.091+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.8.3 And yet the harmonious juxtaposition of musical tones</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.82" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:29:57.526+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.8.4 Words properly aligned become songs,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.90" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:31:03.622+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.8.5 The mourning heart, hidden inside,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.90" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:31:32.557+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">【Application to music and emotions  1.2.8.5 The mourning heart, hidden inside,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.100" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:32:54.143+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.8.6  As customs and manners flow along</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.108" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:33:07.643+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.1.8.7 Happiness, anger, mournfulness and joy,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.108" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:33:47.309+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">【The specific1.2.1.8.7 Happiness, anger, mournfulness and joy,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.115" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:34:41.643+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.9.1 If, for example, because X is talented and I like him subjectively,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.123" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:36:48.043+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.9.2 Talking from this point of view</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.132" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:37:00.991+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.10.1 As for Jizi in Lu</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.136" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:37:30.77+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.10.2 And there again, when Zhongni got to hear the "Shao"</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.138" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:38:54.519+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">why, therefore, has his waxing into a sigh</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.141" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:40:05.173+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.11 So at this point I've roughly explained one basic point in the matter,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.138" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:44:58.093+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">1.2.10c   why, therefore, has his waxing into a sigh</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.123" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T18:45:24.669+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">Detailed application to the case of the emotions  1.2.9.2】 Talking from this point of view</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.115" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-06-01T19:21:17.12+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-en-18cfe757">Logical quibbles   1.2.9.1 If, for example, because X is talented and I like him subjectively,</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-6a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2026-06-02T17:23:47.716+09:00" resp-del="#schwermann" src-id="CH8x3403-de-51efa271">Diejenigen, die in ländlichen Gebieten wohnen, sollten es nicht wagen, Alkohol zu verkaufen.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-6a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2026-06-02T17:42:17.937+09:00" resp-del="#schwermann" src-id="CH8x3403-de-51efa271">Diejenigen </seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-6a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2026-06-02T17:43:39.384+09:00" resp-del="#schwermann" src-id="CH8x3403-de-51efa271">Wenn es jemanden gibt, der diese Vorschrift nicht befolgt, so ist er schuldhaft.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_001-6a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2026-06-02T17:50:58.9+09:00" resp-del="#schwermann" src-id="CH8x3403-de-51efa271">Wenn es jemanden gibt, der diese Vorschrift nicht befolgt, so handelt er schuldhaft.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_002-1a.1-h" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2026-06-02T18:04:07.136+09:00" resp-del="#schwermann" src-id="CH8x3403-de-51efa271">Verwaltungsvorschrift betreffs der Stallungen und Gärten</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_002-1a.1-h" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2026-06-02T18:11:33.789+09:00" resp-del="#schwermann" src-id="CH8x3403-de-51efa271">Normierung der Stallungen und Gärten</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_002-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2026-06-02T18:13:52.669+09:00" resp-del="#schwermann" src-id="CH8x3403-de-51efa271">und im ersten Monat möge man die Ochsen begutachten.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_002-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2026-06-02T18:17:02.041+09:00" resp-del="#schwermann" src-id="CH8x3403-de-51efa271">und im ersten Monat möge man die Zugochsen begutachten.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_002-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2026-06-02T18:24:12.219+09:00" resp-del="#schwermann" src-id="CH8x3403-de-51efa271">Nachdem das Jahr zuende gegangen ist,</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_002-1a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2026-06-02T18:27:36.776+09:00" resp-del="#schwermann" src-id="CH8x3403-de-51efa271">lasse man einen Krug Wein und ein getrocknetes Bündel Fleisch an den örtlichen Verwalter der Felder vergeben.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_002-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2026-06-02T18:44:07.413+09:00" resp-del="#schwermann" src-id="CH8x3403-de-51efa271">Denjenigen, die von Dürre betroffen sind, erlasse man einen Turnus,</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_002-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2026-06-02T18:44:23.542+09:00" resp-del="#schwermann" src-id="CH8x3403-de-51efa271">und schenke dem Viehzüchter dreißig Tage Urlaub.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_002-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2026-06-02T18:45:23.624+09:00" resp-del="#schwermann" src-id="CH8x3403-de-51efa271">und gewähre dem Viehzüchter dreißig Tage Urlaub.</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_002-1a.1-h" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2026-06-02T19:13:36.884+09:00" resp-del="#schwermann" src-id="CH8x3403-de-51efa271">Verwaltungsvorschriften betreffs der Stallungen und Gärten</seg><seg corresp="#CH8x3403_CHANT_002-1a.1-h" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#schwermann" modified="2026-06-02T19:14:45.122+09:00" resp-del="#schwermann" src-id="CH8x3403">In fact, in the manuscript, the titles of the individual documents are always given at the end of them. This title is part of the edition's paratext - and not of the document itself.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1h0001_tls_011-28a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-06-02T21:13:30.128+09:00" resp-del="#dsehnal" src-id="KR1h0001-en-38198f10">"Gaozi said,</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2045_CHANT_230-2a.161" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#fbeck" modified="2026-06-03T18:39:59.184+09:00" resp-del="#fbeck" src-id="CH7x2045-de-ddbc5daa">Wie ist es dass die Zuneigung</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2045_CHANT_230-2a.165" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#fbeck" modified="2026-06-03T18:43:39.492+09:00" resp-del="#fbeck" src-id="CH7x2045-de-ddbc5daa">Alle Anwesenden </seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2045_CHANT_444-4a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#fbeck" modified="2026-06-03T18:49:17.146+09:00" resp-del="#fbeck" src-id="CH7x2045-de-ddbc5daa">und ließ die Truppen biwakieren/kantonieren/stationieren (?).</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2045_CHANT_444-4a.183" xml:lang="en" resp="#fbeck" modified="2026-06-03T18:50:36.817+09:00" resp-del="#fbeck" src-id="CH7x2045-de-ddbc5daa">Einige Schwffel berühmter Doftstoffe,</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2045_CHANT_444-4a.183" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#fbeck" modified="2026-06-03T18:50:41.44+09:00" resp-del="#fbeck" src-id="CH7x2045-de-ddbc5daa">Einige Scheffel berühmter Doftstoffe,</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2045_CHANT_444-4a.184" xml:lang="en" resp="#fbeck" modified="2026-06-03T18:50:45.558+09:00" resp-del="#fbeck" src-id="CH7x2045-de-ddbc5daa">ein Paar prächtige Schweter</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2045_CHANT_444-4a.162" xml:lang="en" resp="#fbeck" modified="2026-06-03T18:50:53.821+09:00" resp-del="#fbeck" src-id="CH7x2045-de-ddbc5daa">und versuchte die Fesseln abzustreifen - erfolglos.</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2045_CHANT_444-4a.176" xml:lang="en" resp="#fbeck" modified="2026-06-03T18:51:12.422+09:00" resp-del="#fbeck" src-id="CH7x2045-de-ddbc5daa">Da brach seine Rede und starb.</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2045_CHANT_444-4a.191" xml:lang="en" resp="#fbeck" modified="2026-06-03T18:51:54.495+09:00" resp-del="#fbeck" src-id="CH7x2045-de-ddbc5daa">sei einzigartig [=unersetzbar?] gewesen.</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2045_CHANT_444-4a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#fbeck" modified="2026-06-03T18:54:07.239+09:00" resp-del="#fbeck" src-id="CH7x2045-de-ddbc5daa">Ouyang He</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2045_CHANT_230-2a.116" xml:lang="en" resp="#fbeck" modified="2026-06-03T18:54:34.121+09:00" resp-del="#fbeck" src-id="CH7x2045-de-a10e339b">Kommentar!</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2045_CHANT_358-4a.97" xml:lang="en" resp="#fbeck" modified="2026-06-03T18:56:14.533+09:00" resp-del="#fbeck" src-id="CH7x2045-de-ddbc5daa">ihre Kleider ganz schwer [vor Wasser?].</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>